<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event</p><h1 class="enc-title">2008 Summer Olympics</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">2008</span> · <a href="/centuries/21st-century">21st century</a> · Also known as Beijing 2008, Beijing Olympics</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The 2008 Summer Olympics were held in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beijing">Beijing</a> from 8 to 24 August 2008, the first Olympic Games hosted by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>. The opening ceremony in the new National Stadium, known as the Bird's Nest, and China's lead in gold medals were presented as symbols of the country's rise, while the Games also drew protests over <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tibet">Tibet</a> and human rights.</p></div>
